{"product_id":"postcards-from-the-cinema","title":"Postcards from the Cinema","description":"\u003cp\u003ePostcards from the Cinema is the book Serge Daney, one of the greatest of film critics, never wrote. It is based around an interview that was to be the starting point for a book, a project cut short by Daney's death. Postcards turns a history of cinema into a profound meditation on the art and politics of film.Daney's passionate and lucid engagement with film, combined with his concern for journalistic clarity, effectively created film criticism as a genre. Equally at home with the theories of Deleuze, Lacan and Debord as he was with the movie-making of Bunuel, Godard and Ray, Daney was also a fan of Jerry Lewis and Hitchcock. At the same time - and before his time - he championed the critical analysis of television and other audio-visual media.Long-awaited, this is the first book-length translation of Daney's work, testimony to a life lived with a fierce love of film.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 156 x 234\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Serge Daney | Paul Douglas Grant\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781845206512\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 160\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45890775154841,"sku":"14RB9781845206512","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/6914888cebe71_Postcards_from_the_Cinema.jpg?v=1763046889","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/postcards-from-the-cinema","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}